==================================================
4. إصلاح aiogram v3
==================================================

المشروع يجب أن يستخدم aiogram v3 فقط.

ممنوع وجود:
- Application
- Application.builder
- telegram.ext
- python-telegram-bot
- CommandHandler
- CallbackQueryHandler
- MessageHandler
- filters.TEXT
- from aiogram.filters import Text

استخدم فقط:
- Bot
- Dispatcher
- Router
- F
- Command
- CommandStart
- Message
- CallbackQuery
- InlineKeyboardMarkup
- InlineKeyboardButton

إذا وجدت Text من aiogram.filters:
استبدله بـ F.

أمثلة:
Text(text="x") → F.text == "x"
Text(startswith="x") → F.text.startswith("x")
Text(contains="x") → F.text.contains("x")
Callback data → F.data == "..."
Callback prefix → F.data.startswith("...")

